// REJECTS: Field 'dataProcessingUnits' is required
//
// PersistenceCloudParserGrammar is the smallest grammar in the whole surface: one rule, one
// keyword. `definition: (awsGlueDpuCount)* EOF` -- a star, so an EMPTY AwsGlue island is a
// complete parse tree, and PersistenceCloudParseTreeWalker requires the field.
//
// Worth its own file because it proves the island body reached the cloud grammar at all: if
// the AwsGlue processor were missing from the classpath this would fail with an
// "Unsupported persistence platform type" instead, and the two are indistinguishable without
// the message.
###Persistence
PersistenceContext test::persistence::neg::AwsGlueNoDpu
{
  persistence: test::persistence::TestPersistence;
  platform: AwsGlue
  #{
  }#;
}
